# Density and mass (an extension): the extrusion of path_extrude, its
# group screen's density set to 7.85 g/cm³ on the appearance row, and
# Analyze > Measure Volume giving the mass, as the screen, the message
# and the file show.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
twmove 676 245
twdown L 676 245
twup L 676 245
edit 7.85
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Measure Volume
save
